seoa: SEO analyzer

Portions of this project are derived from claude-seo
(https://github.com/AgriciDaniel/claude-seo), v2.6.0, MIT License.

Derived files (update this list whenever a file is ported or adapted):

  src/seoa/domain/url_safety.py
      from scripts/url_safety.py (is_safe_ip, normalize_hostname, authority-confusion
      rejection, blocked hostnames, DNS64 handling). The CLAUDE_SEO_LOCAL_TARGETS
      allowlist, the global socket.getaddrinfo DNS pin and the HTTP proxy handling
      were deliberately NOT ported.
  src/seoa/domain/rules/page_checks.py, rules_page.py, messages_page.py
      from scripts/page_checks.py (the 47 page checks, their ids, severities, messages)
  src/seoa/domain/rules/rules_site.py, schema_checks.py
      transport and schema rule ids and severities, from the same project's references
  src/seoa/domain/parsing/html.py
      from scripts/page_checks.py and scripts/parse_html.py
  src/seoa/application/crawl/sitemap.py
      from scripts/sitemap_discovery.py
  src/seoa/application/site/robots.py
      group selection and path matching, from scripts/agentic_check.py
  src/seoa/application/analysis/modules/agentic.py
      from scripts/agentic_check.py (llms.txt format rules, Markdown delivery)
  src/seoa/application/analysis/modules/hreflang.py, schema_suggest.py, schema_templates.py
      from skills/seo-hreflang and skills/seo-schema
  src/seoa/application/analysis/links/rules.py, performance/web_vitals.py
      thresholds and rule wording from skills/seo-technical and references/cwv-thresholds.md
  src/seoa/infrastructure/http/transport.py
      from scripts/transport_check.py
  src/seoa/infrastructure/rendering/js_gap.py, spa.py
      from scripts/render_page.py (_gap_signals, _only_after, _is_spa)
  data/rules/ai-crawlers.json, known-wrong-facts.json
      statements and lists copied from the same project

